{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764070/extras/bda66b555e6c9aae18d58ec191bbe14a.avif?t=1765291645\" width=1600 height=868 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prepare to rise as a legendary hero in an adventure filled with action, tight jumps, and challenges designed to sharpen your reflexes. Clever enemies track your every move, and relentless bosses push your courage to the limit, forcing you to react fast and prove your true strength. With its colorful style, accessible gameplay, and fun atmosphere for all ages, Heroic Hop blends excitement, charm, and the joy of overcoming every challenge like a true hero.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Core Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tight 2D platforming controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tricky traps, crumbling grounds, and vertical challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intelligent enemies that chase and react to the player</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Platforms that move, rotate, rise, and fall</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demo available now!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Available in English, Spanish, Portuguese, German, French, and Italian</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764070/extras/c3226ff7c490e5d5e5ae26c67cdc027d.avif?t=1765291645\" width=1600 height=868 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3764070?t=1765291645","background_raw":"https://shared.akam